{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't Let It Starve</strong> is a strategy rogue-lite game where you must prepare the most satisfying bentos for a half-chef monster lurking in the ventilation ducts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930510/extras/4b72aac58b772f9b76b3bb9e8fe22a4c.poster.avif?t=1760012778\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930510/extras/4b72aac58b772f9b76b3bb9e8fe22a4c.webm?t=1760012778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930510/extras/4b72aac58b772f9b76b3bb9e8fe22a4c.mp4?t=1760012778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grid-Based Bento Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare bentos by arranging food in a grid.<br>Choose ingredients wisely and optimize your layout to fit as much as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930510/extras/03fef79f6ab61b633fc9dddb8ef0b635.poster.avif?t=1760012778\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930510/extras/03fef79f6ab61b633fc9dddb8ef0b635.webm?t=1760012778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930510/extras/03fef79f6ab61b633fc9dddb8ef0b635.mp4?t=1760012778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Possibilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match dozens of tools and effects.<br>Each run is unique, with countless ways to stay alive\u2026 or fail horribly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930510/extras/b7538323be9c1c6dad9e10f083864ed1.poster.avif?t=1760012778\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930510/extras/b7538323be9c1c6dad9e10f083864ed1.webm?t=1760012778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930510/extras/b7538323be9c1c6dad9e10f083864ed1.mp4?t=1760012778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Satisfying Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy better tools, pick the best ingredients, and push your food points to the max.<br>The more you please the creature, the longer you live.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930510/extras/77ec9b4196e8f2ab6cc4cd06d9ddf5bb.poster.avif?t=1760012778\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930510/extras/77ec9b4196e8f2ab6cc4cd06d9ddf5bb.webm?t=1760012778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930510/extras/77ec9b4196e8f2ab6cc4cd06d9ddf5bb.mp4?t=1760012778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta-Progression</strong> \u2013 Unlock new tools, upgrades, and run modifiers that change future attempts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>120+ Unique Items &amp; Synergies</strong> \u2013 Experiment with a huge variety of tools and effects to create deadly-efficient strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong> \u2013 Push your skills (and your luck) to the limit in an infinite survival challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 You're not alone in the kitchen. </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3930510?t=1760012778","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930510/5315fc90f3ef5c0cac90393af39e7715fd30f067/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760012778","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930510/6e82fcf58bbb57e13f3945c9bfd8e57901e12b72/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760012778","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930510/6e82fcf58bbb57e13f3945c9bfd8e57901e12b72/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760012778","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3977370,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't Let It Starve</strong> is a strategy rogue-lite game where you must prepare the most satisfying bentos for a half-chef monster lurking in the ventilation ducts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930510/extras/4b72aac58b772f9b76b3bb9e8fe22a4c.poster.avif?t=1760012778\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930510/extras/4b72aac58b772f9b76b3bb9e8fe22a4c.webm?t=1760012778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"http